MoneyPrinterTurbo — 唤星 (Huanxing) reel fork
================================================

This repository is a fork of MoneyPrinterTurbo, adapted for the 唤星 (Huanxing)
AI-Native application platform as the "reel" short-video synthesis engine
(app_id = `reel`, downloadable_local sidecar form).

