Huanxing fork modifications
---------------------------
Branch  : huanxing-reel
Scope (design doc: docs/hasn-node设计文档/14-AI-Native应用平台/19-MoneyPrinterTurbo短视频合成应用接入设计.md):

- app/config/config.py        : REEL_* runtime env injection (PDC authority), gateway
                                 credentials helper, LLM failover list, upload_post off.
- app/services/llm.py         : LLM gateway capture + candidate-chain failover with real
                                 upstream error pass-through (new-api OpenAI-compatible).
- app/services/voice.py       : reel TTS provider switch (edge default / platform skeleton).
- app/services/material.py    : stock keys injected via REEL_PEXELS/PIXABAY_API_KEYS
                                 (multi-key rotation; consumed unchanged via config).
- app/utils/utils.py          : storage root redirect to REEL_MEDIA_ROOT.
- app/services/task.py        : video_source=auto (owned-first + stock gap-fill, §6.6).
- app/api/huanxing_security.py: token gate (X-Reel-Token) + Host gate + CORS hardening.
- app/controllers/v1/reel.py  : new /api/v1/reel/* endpoints (materials/search + JSONL events).
- app/router.py, app/asgi.py  : wiring for the above.
- app/services/upload_post.py : third-party publishing hard-disabled (§9).

Modified/new files carry an inline "唤星 reel" comment marking the change.

Huanxing fork changes are likewise provided under the MIT License, consistent
with the upstream project.
